arxiv.org/abs/1611.02779","#component-two-memory","https://chat.openai.com/share/46ff149e-a4c7-4dd7-a800-fc4a642ea389","#types-of-memory","psychclassics.yorku.ca/Miller/","#maximum-inner-product-search-mips","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_inner-product_search","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Locality-sensitive_hashing","https://github.com/spotify/annoy","https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.09320","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Small-world_network","https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss","https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/scann","https://ann-benchmarks.com/","#component-three-tool-use","https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.00445","https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.12255","https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.04761","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-03-15-prompt-engineering/#external-apis","https://openai.com/blog/chatgpt-plugins","https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt/function-calling","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.17580","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.08244","#case-studies","#scientific-discovery-agent","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.05376","https://github.com/hwchase17/langchain","#react","#mrkl","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.05332","#generative-agents-simulation","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.03442","#self-reflection","#proof-of-concept-examples","https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","#challenges","#citation","#references","https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.11903","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10601","https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.02676","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.11477","https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629","https://ai.googleblog.com/2020/07/announcing-scann-efficient-vector.html","https://chat.openai.com/share/46ff149e-a4c7-4dd7-a800-fc4a642ea389","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11366","https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.14215","https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.00445","https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.09332","https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.12255","https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.04761","https://weaviate.io/blog/why-is-vector-search-so-fast","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.08244","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.17580","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.05376","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.05332","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.03442","https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","https://lilianweng.github.io/tags/nlp/","https://lilianweng.github.io/tags/language-model/","https://lilianweng.github.io/tags/agent/","https://lilianweng.github.io/tags/steerability/","https://lilianweng.github.io/tags/prompting/"],"category":"CompositeElement","languages":["eng"],"url":"https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-06-23-agent/","chroma:document":"The design of generative agents combines LLM with memory, planning and reflection mechanisms to enable agents to behave conditioned on past experience, as well as to interact with other agents.\n\nMemory stream: is a long-term memory module (external database) that records a comprehensive list of agentsâ€™ experience in natural language.\n\nEach element is an observation, an event directly provided by the agent. - Inter-agent communication can trigger new natural language statements.\n\nRetrieval model: surfaces the context to inform the agentâ€™s behavior, according to relevance, recency and importance.\n\nRecency: recent events have higher scores\n\nImportance: distinguish mundane from core memories. Ask LM directly.\n\nRelevance: based on how related it is to the current situation / query.\n\nReflection mechanism: synthesizes memories into higher level inferences over time and guides the agentâ€™s future behavior. They are higher-level summaries of past events (<- note that this is a bit different from self-reflection above)","emphasized_text_tags":["b","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","i","b","b","i","b","b","b","b","i","b","i","b","i","b","b","i","b","i","b","i","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","i","i","i","b","b","b","i","b","b","i","b","b","b","b"],"filetype":"text/html","orig_elements":"","emphasized_text_contents":["Planning","Memory","Tool use","Chain of thought","Tree of Thoughts","LLM+P","ReAct","Reflexion","decide to reset","Chain of Hindsight","Algorithm Distillation","algorithm","Sensory Memory","Short-Term Memory","Working Memory","Long-Term Memory","approximate nearest neighbors (ANN)â€‹","LSH","hashing","ANNOY","random projection trees","HNSW","FAISS","clustering","ScaNN","anisotropic vector quantization","MRKL","knowing when to and how to use the tools are crucial","TALM","Toolformer","HuggingGPT","(1) Task planning","(2) Model selection","(3) Task execution","(4) Response generation","API-Bank","call the API","retrieve the API","plan API beyond retrieve and call","ChemCrow","Generative Agents","Memory","observation","Retrieval","Reflection","higher-level summaries of past events","Planning & Reacting","Finite context length","Challenges in long-term planning and task decomposition","Reliability of natural language interface"],"link_texts":["AutoGPT","GPT-Engineer","BabyAGI","#","Prompt Engineering","#","#","Chain of thought","Wei et al. 2022","Yao et al. 2023","Liu et al. 2023","#","Yao et al. 2023","Shinn & Labash 2023","Liu et al. 2023","WebGPT comparisons","summarization from human feedback","human preference dataset","Laskin et al. 2023","UCB","Duan et al. 2017","#","conversations","#","Miller 1956","#","MIPS","LSH","ANNOY","HNSW","small world networks","FAISS","ScaNN","ann-benchmarks.com","#","Karpas et al. 2022","Parisi et al. 2022","Schick et al. 2023","â€œExternal APIsâ€ section","Plugins","function calling","Shen et al. 2023","Li et al. 2023","#","#","Bran et al. 2023","LangChain","ReAct","MRKLs","Boiko et al. (2023)","#","Park, et al. 2023","self-reflection","#","AutoGPT","GPT-Engineer","#","#","#","â€œChain of thought prompting elicits reasoning in large language models.â€","â€œTree of Thoughts: Dliberate Problem Solving with Large Language Models.â€","â€œChain of Hindsight Aligns Language Models with Feedback â€œ","â€œLLM+P: Empowering Large Language Models with Optimal Planning Proficiencyâ€","â€œReAct: Synergizing reasoning and acting in language models.â€","â€œAnnouncing ScaNN: Efficient Vector Similarity Searchâ€","https://chat.openai.com/share/46ff149e-a4c7-4dd7-a800-fc4a642ea389","â€œReflexion: an autonomous agent with dynamic memory and self-reflectionâ€","â€œIn-context Reinforcement Learning with Algorithm Distillationâ€","â€œMRKL Systems A modular, neuro-symbolic architecture that combines large language models, external knowledge sources and discrete reasoning.â€","â€œWebgpt: Browser-assisted question-answering with human feedback.â€","â€œTALM: Tool Augmented Language Modelsâ€","â€œToolformer: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Use Tools.â€","Why is Vector Search so fast?","â€œAPI-Bank: A Benchmark for Tool-Augmented LLMsâ€","â€œHuggingGPT: Solving AI Tasks with ChatGPT and its Friends in HuggingFaceâ€","â€œChemCrow: Augmenting large-language models with chemistry tools.â€","â€œEmergent autonomous scientific research capabilities of large language models.â€","â€œGenerative Agents: Interactive Simulacra of Human Behavior.â€","https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","Nlp","Language-Model","Agent","Steerability","Prompting"]}␀␀␀Às8{␀␀␀0îz␀␀␀æge*é¥áxðs8{␀␀␀00îz␀␀␀™RXWê~bÃ t8{␀␀␀P0îz␀␀␀<:ô
