ing with Algorithm Distillationâ€","â€œMRKL Systems A modular, neuro-symbolic architecture that combines large language models, external knowledge sources and discrete reasoning.â€","â€œWebgpt: Browser-assisted question-answering with human feedback.â€","â€œTALM: Tool Augmented Language Modelsâ€","â€œToolformer: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Use Tools.â€","Why is Vector Search so fast?","â€œAPI-Bank: A Benchmark for Tool-Augmented LLMsâ€","â€œHuggingGPT: Solving AI Tasks with ChatGPT and its Friends in HuggingFaceâ€","â€œChemCrow: Augmenting large-language models with chemistry tools.â€","â€œEmergent autonomous scientific research capabilities of large language models.â€","â€œGenerative Agents: Interactive Simulacra of Human Behavior.â€","https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","Nlp","Language-Model","Agent","Steerability","Prompting"],"category":"CompositeElement","emphasized_text_tags":["b","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","i","b","b","i","b","b","b","b","i","b","i","b","i","b","b","i","b","i","b","i","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","b","i","i","i","b","b","b","i","b","b","i","b","b","b","b"],"url":"https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-06-23-agent/","emphasized_text_contents":["Planning","Memory","Tool use","Chain of thought","Tree of Thoughts","LLM+P","ReAct","Reflexion","decide to reset","Chain of Hindsight","Algorithm Distillation","algorithm","Sensory Memory","Short-Term Memory","Working Memory","Long-Term Memory","approximate nearest neighbors (ANN)â€‹","LSH","hashing","ANNOY","random projection trees","HNSW","FAISS","clustering","ScaNN","anisotropic vector quantization","MRKL","knowing when to and how to use the tools are crucial","TALM","Toolformer","HuggingGPT","(1) Task planning","(2) Model selection","(3) Task execution","(4) Response generation","API-Bank","call the API","retrieve the API","plan API beyond retrieve and call","ChemCrow","Generative Agents","Memory","observation","Retrieval","Reflection","higher-level summaries of past events","Planning & Reacting","Finite context length","Challenges in long-term planning and task decomposition","Reliability of natural language interface"],"languages":["eng"],"chroma:document":"AutoGPT has drawn a lot of attention into the possibility of setting up autonomous agents with LLM as the main controller. It has quite a lot of reliability issues given the natural language interface, but nevertheless a cool proof-of-concept demo. A lot of code in AutoGPT is about format parsing.\n\nHere is the system message used by AutoGPT, where {{...}} are user inputs:\n\nYou are {{ai-name}}, {{user-provided AI bot description}}.\nYour decisions must always be made independently without seeking user assistance. Play to your strengths as an LLM and pursue simple strategies with no legal complications.\n\nGOALS:\n\n1. {{user-provided goal 1}}\n2. {{user-provided goal 2}}\n3. ...\n4. ...\n5. ...","filetype":"text/html","link_urls":["https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","https://github.com/yoheinakajima/babyagi","#agent-system-overview","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-03-15-prompt-engineering/","#component-one-planning","#task-decomposition","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-03-15-prompt-engineering/#chain-of-thought-cot","https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.11903","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10601","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.11477","#self-reflection","https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11366","https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.02676","https://huggingface.co/datasets/openai/webgpt_comparisons","https://github.com/openai/summarize-from-feedback","https://github.com/anthropics/hh-rlhf","https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.14215","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2018-01-23-multi-armed-bandit/#upper-confidence-bounds","https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.02779","#component-two-memory","https://chat.openai.com/share/46ff149e-a4c7-4dd7-a800-fc4a642ea389","#typ