","â€œReAct: Synergizing reasoning and acting in language models.â€","â€œAnnouncing ScaNN: Efficient Vector Similarity Searchâ€","https://chat.openai.com/share/46ff149e-a4c7-4dd7-a800-fc4a642ea389","â€œReflexion: an autonomous agent with dynamic memory and self-reflectionâ€","â€œIn-context Reinforcement Learning with Algorithm Distillationâ€","â€œMRKL Systems A modular, neuro-symbolic architecture that combines large language models, external knowledge sources and discrete reasoning.â€","â€œWebgpt: Browser-assisted question-answering with human feedback.â€","â€œTALM: Tool Augmented Language Modelsâ€","â€œToolformer: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Use Tools.â€","Why is Vector Search so fast?","â€œAPI-Bank: A Benchmark for Tool-Augmented LLMsâ€","â€œHuggingGPT: Solving AI Tasks with ChatGPT and its Friends in HuggingFaceâ€","â€œChemCrow: Augmenting large-language models with chemistry tools.â€","â€œEmergent autonomous scientific research capabilities of large language models.â€","â€œGenerative Agents: Interactive Simulacra of Human Behavior.â€","https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","Nlp","Language-Model","Agent","Steerability","Prompting"],"chroma:document":"\"content\": \"Summary of areas that need clarification:\\n1. Specifics of the Super Mario game (e.g. level design, characters, gameplay mechanics)\\n2. Details about the MVC components (e.g. which components are in each file)\\n3. Keyboard control implementation (e.g. which keys to use, how to handle input)\\n\\nClarifying question:\\nCan you provide more details about the Super Mario game, such as level design, characters, and gameplay mechanics?\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": \"{{There are 10 levels in total. The main character is a plumber named Mario, who can walk and jump. It is a classical platform game just like Super Mario. The main character moves from left to right, trying to get to the destination, where there are many obstacles and attacks from enemies in the process.}}\\n\\nIs anything else unclear? If yes, only answer in the form:\\n{remaining unclear areas} remaining questions.\\n{Next question}\\nIf everything is sufficiently clear, only answer \\\"Nothing more to clarify.\\\".\"","category":"CompositeElement","filetype":"text/html","url":"https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-06-23-agent/","emphasized_text_contents":["Planning","Memory","Tool use","Chain of thought","Tree of Thoughts","LLM+P","ReAct","Reflexion","decide to reset","Chain of Hindsight","Algorithm Distillation","algorithm","Sensory Memory","Short-Term Memory","Working Memory","Long-Term Memory","approximate nearest neighbors (ANN)â€‹","LSH","hashing","ANNOY","random projection trees","HNSW","FAISS","clustering","ScaNN","anisotropic vector quantization","MRKL","knowing when to and how to use the tools are crucial","TALM","Toolformer","HuggingGPT","(1) Task planning","(2) Model selection","(3) Task execution","(4) Response generation","API-Bank","call the API","retrieve the API","plan API beyond retrieve and call","ChemCrow","Generative Agents","Memory","observation","Retrieval","Reflection","higher-level summaries of past events","Planning & Reacting","Finite context length","Challenges in long-term planning and task decomposition","Reliability of natural language interface"],"orig_elements":"","element_id":"6271486d1888e0fd913dfc39756b1453","link_urls":["https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/Auto-GPT","https://github.com/AntonOsika/gpt-engineer","https://github.com/yoheinakajima/babyagi","#agent-system-overview","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-03-15-prompt-engineering/","#component-one-planning","#task-decomposition","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-03-15-prompt-engineering/#chain-of-thought-cot","https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.11903","https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10601","https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.11477","#self-reflection","https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629","https://arxiv.o